      "defect": "false-claim",
      "evidence": "The item states that for α=dz-x dy, α∧dα=dx∧dy∧dz. But dα=-dx∧dy, so α∧dα=(dz-x dy)∧(-dx∧dy)=-dz∧dx∧dy=-dx∧dy∧dz. The nonvanishing and nonintegrability conclusions remain true, but the displayed signed equality is false.",
